{"id":"55353aba49d6b3f2","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-primitive-recursive.md","title":"Primitive-Recursive Functions, Programs and Predicates","display":"df-primitive-recursive — Primitive-Recursive Functions, Programs and Predicates","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-primitive-recursive","aliases":["67-df-primitive-recursive"],"display":"df-primitive-recursive — Primitive-Recursive Functions, Programs and Predicates","depends_on":["[[67-df-sequence]]"],"revision_status":"locally-reconstructed","machine_verified":false,"verification_status":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-primitive-recursive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-primitive-recursive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-primitive-recursive — Primitive-Recursive Functions, Programs and Predicates"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"338538aaf52f60c4\" href=\"?note=338538aaf52f60c4\" title=\"67-df-sequence\">67-df-sequence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-reconstructed"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^0=\\{\\epsilon\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N^0=\\{\\epsilon\\}\\)</span>。程序是下列带标签有限树；不同程序即使计算同一函数也不合并。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\)</span> 由下列构造归纳生成；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦ e⟧\">\\(⟦ e⟧\\)</span> 按程序树及递归参数定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf C\">\\(\\mathsf C\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec e\">\\(\\vec e\\)</span> 长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_m\">\\(d\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_i\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\">\\(e_i\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf R\">\\(\\mathsf R\\)</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\">\\(d\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_{k+2}\">\\(e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_{k+2}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>自然数程序码用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"338538aaf52f60c4\" href=\"?note=338538aaf52f60c4\" title=\"67-df-sequence\">67-df-sequence</a> 的有限列编码递归编码标签和子树；符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 同时指程序及其唯一代码，依上下文类型区分。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_X\">\\(\\chi_X\\)</span> 使用成立取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 的约定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf Z_k&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle0,k\\rangle),&amp;\\mathsf S&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle1\\rangle),\\\\\n\\mathsf P_{k,i}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle2,k,i\\rangle),&amp;\n\\mathsf C_k(d,\\vec e)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle3,k,d,\\operatorname{enc}(\\vec e)\\rangle),\\\\\n\\mathsf R(d,e)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle4,d,e\\rangle).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf Z_k&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle0,k\\rangle),&amp;\\mathsf S&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle1\\rangle),\\\\\n\\mathsf P_{k,i}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle2,k,i\\rangle),&amp;\n\\mathsf C_k(d,\\vec e)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle3,k,d,\\operatorname{enc}(\\vec e)\\rangle),\\\\\n\\mathsf R(d,e)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle4,d,e\\rangle).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathsf Z_k\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k,\\qquad\\mathsf S\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_1,\\qquad\n\\mathsf P_{k,i}\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\quad(i&lt;k),\\\\\n\\frac{d\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_m\\quad\\vec e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k^m}{\\mathsf C_k(d,\\vec e)\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k},\\qquad\n\\frac{d\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\quad e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_{k+2}}{\\mathsf R(d,e)\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_{k+1}}.\\\\\n\\mathcal K\\coloneqq\\bigl\\{(X_k)_k\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)^{\\mathbb N}:\n\\forall k\\ (\\mathsf Z_k\\in X_k)\\land\\mathsf S\\in X_1\n\\land\\forall k\\forall i&lt;k\\ (\\mathsf P_{k,i}\\in X_k)\n\\land\\forall k,m\\forall d\\in X_m\\forall\\vec e\\in X_k^m\\ (\\mathsf C_k(d,\\vec e)\\in X_k)\n\\land\\forall k\\forall d\\in X_k\\forall e\\in X_{k+2}\\ (\\mathsf R(d,e)\\in X_{k+1})\\bigr\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X_k:(X_j)_j\\in\\mathcal K\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathsf Z_k\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k,\\qquad\\mathsf S\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_1,\\qquad\n\\mathsf P_{k,i}\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\quad(i&lt;k),\\\\\n\\frac{d\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_m\\quad\\vec e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k^m}{\\mathsf C_k(d,\\vec e)\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k},\\qquad\n\\frac{d\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\quad e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_{k+2}}{\\mathsf R(d,e)\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_{k+1}}.\\\\\n\\mathcal K\\coloneqq\\bigl\\{(X_k)_k\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)^{\\mathbb N}:\n\\forall k\\ (\\mathsf Z_k\\in X_k)\\land\\mathsf S\\in X_1\n\\land\\forall k\\forall i&lt;k\\ (\\mathsf P_{k,i}\\in X_k)\n\\land\\forall k,m\\forall d\\in X_m\\forall\\vec e\\in X_k^m\\ (\\mathsf C_k(d,\\vec e)\\in X_k)\n\\land\\forall k\\forall d\\in X_k\\forall e\\in X_{k+2}\\ (\\mathsf R(d,e)\\in X_{k+1})\\bigr\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X_k:(X_j)_j\\in\\mathcal K\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n⟦\\mathsf Z_k⟧(\\vec x)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;⟦\\mathsf S⟧(x)&amp;\\coloneqq x+1,&amp;⟦\\mathsf P_{k,i}⟧(\\vec x)&amp;\\coloneqq x_i,\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf C_k(d,\\vec e)⟧(\\vec x)&amp;\\coloneqq⟦ d⟧((⟦ e_i⟧(\\vec x))_{i&lt;m}),\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf R(d,e)⟧(\\vec x,0)&amp;\\coloneqq⟦ d⟧(\\vec x),\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf R(d,e)⟧(\\vec x,n+1)&amp;\\coloneqq⟦ e⟧(\\vec x,n,⟦\\mathsf R(d,e)⟧(\\vec x,n)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PR}_k&amp;\\coloneqq\\{⟦ e⟧:e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\},\\\\\n\\chi_X(\\vec n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\vec n\\in X,\\\\0,&amp;\\vec n\\notin X,\\end{cases}&amp;\n\\mathrm{PRPred}_k&amp;\\coloneqq\\{X\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k:\\chi_X\\in\\mathrm{PR}_k\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n⟦\\mathsf Z_k⟧(\\vec x)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;⟦\\mathsf S⟧(x)&amp;\\coloneqq x+1,&amp;⟦\\mathsf P_{k,i}⟧(\\vec x)&amp;\\coloneqq x_i,\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf C_k(d,\\vec e)⟧(\\vec x)&amp;\\coloneqq⟦ d⟧((⟦ e_i⟧(\\vec x))_{i&lt;m}),\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf R(d,e)⟧(\\vec x,0)&amp;\\coloneqq⟦ d⟧(\\vec x),\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf R(d,e)⟧(\\vec x,n+1)&amp;\\coloneqq⟦ e⟧(\\vec x,n,⟦\\mathsf R(d,e)⟧(\\vec x,n)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PR}_k&amp;\\coloneqq\\{⟦ e⟧:e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\},\\\\\n\\chi_X(\\vec n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\vec n\\in X,\\\\0,&amp;\\vec n\\notin X,\\end{cases}&amp;\n\\mathrm{PRPred}_k&amp;\\coloneqq\\{X\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k:\\chi_X\\in\\mathrm{PR}_k\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原始递归程序与它计算的外延函数分开。后续统一图公式构造接收程序码，不假定能从一个外延函数有效选出其程序。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"338538aaf52f60c4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"338538aaf52f60c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"自然数程序码用 [[67-df-sequence]] 的有限列编码递归编码标签和子树；符号 $e$ 同时指程序及其唯一代码，依上下文类型区分。$\\chi_X$ 使用成立取 $1$ 的约定。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"k,m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N^0=\\{\\epsilon\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PRProg}_k","display":false},{"tex":"⟦ e⟧","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf C","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec e","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_m","display":false},{"tex":"e_i\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf R","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_{k+2}","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_X","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf Z_k&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle0,k\\rangle),&\\mathsf S&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle1\\rangle),\\\\\n\\mathsf P_{k,i}&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle2,k,i\\rangle),&\n\\mathsf C_k(d,\\vec e)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle3,k,d,\\operatorname{enc}(\\vec e)\\rangle),\\\\\n\\mathsf R(d,e)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle4,d,e\\rangle).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathsf Z_k\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k,\\qquad\\mathsf S\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_1,\\qquad\n\\mathsf P_{k,i}\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\quad(i<k),\\\\\n\\frac{d\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_m\\quad\\vec e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k^m}{\\mathsf C_k(d,\\vec e)\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k},\\qquad\n\\frac{d\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\quad e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_{k+2}}{\\mathsf R(d,e)\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_{k+1}}.\\\\\n\\mathcal K\\coloneqq\\bigl\\{(X_k)_k\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)^{\\mathbb N}:\n\\forall k\\ (\\mathsf Z_k\\in X_k)\\land\\mathsf S\\in X_1\n\\land\\forall k\\forall i<k\\ (\\mathsf P_{k,i}\\in X_k)\n\\land\\forall k,m\\forall d\\in X_m\\forall\\vec e\\in X_k^m\\ (\\mathsf C_k(d,\\vec e)\\in X_k)\n\\land\\forall k\\forall d\\in X_k\\forall e\\in X_{k+2}\\ (\\mathsf R(d,e)\\in X_{k+1})\\bigr\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X_k:(X_j)_j\\in\\mathcal K\\}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n⟦\\mathsf Z_k⟧(\\vec x)&\\coloneqq0,&⟦\\mathsf S⟧(x)&\\coloneqq x+1,&⟦\\mathsf P_{k,i}⟧(\\vec x)&\\coloneqq x_i,\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf C_k(d,\\vec e)⟧(\\vec x)&\\coloneqq⟦ d⟧((⟦ e_i⟧(\\vec x))_{i<m}),\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf R(d,e)⟧(\\vec x,0)&\\coloneqq⟦ d⟧(\\vec x),\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf R(d,e)⟧(\\vec x,n+1)&\\coloneqq⟦ e⟧(\\vec x,n,⟦\\mathsf R(d,e)⟧(\\vec x,n)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PR}_k&\\coloneqq\\{⟦ e⟧:e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\},\\\\\n\\chi_X(\\vec n)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&\\vec n\\in X,\\\\0,&\\vec n\\notin X,\\end{cases}&\n\\mathrm{PRPred}_k&\\coloneqq\\{X\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k:\\chi_X\\in\\mathrm{PR}_k\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3191,"backlinks":[{"id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L_A=L_{\\mathrm{arith}}$；公式、自由变量、无捕获代入、变量表的 $\\mathrm{Distinct}_{L_A}$、$\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_A}$ 和 $\\bar m$ 取 [[67-df-formula]] 的算术实例及标准数词。$\\mathrm{PR}_k$ 取 [[67-df-primitive-recursive]]，$k\\ge1$。"},{"id":"189f5355af0e487c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}